</span></th>
<th id="S1.T1.12.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_align_middle ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.65pt 4.5pt;"><span id="S1.T1.12.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Data Size</span></th>
