<figure id="S5.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span><span id="S5.T4.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Average gains under stage-replacement interventions.</span>
Each value reports the model-averaged accuracy gain corresponding to Table <a href="#S5.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ 5.2 Results Analysis ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ ClinHallu: A Benchmark for Diagnosing Stage-wise Hallucinations in Medical MLLM Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>.
Darker cells indicate larger gains. The varying patterns suggest that hallucination bottlenecks differ across datasets.</figcaption>
